{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This pack includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Premium heavy tank Tiger H1 West Camo (Rank IV, Germany)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Premium crew of 5 tankers of level 4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300 Gold</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tiger H1 is a German heavy tank that became one of the most recognizable symbols of World War II. Its main armament is the 88 mm KwK 36 L/56 gun, derived from the famous FlaK 18/36 anti-aircraft cannon. The weapon is noted for its high accuracy and impressive muzzle velocity, allowing it to reliably destroy enemy armor at long range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game, the vehicle comes with an ambush camouflage net, designed for sudden attacks from wooded cover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional armament includes a 7.92 mm MG34 machine gun with 4,350 rounds of ammunition, as well as 6 smoke grenades for deploying concealment screens. The combination of reliable armor and powerful weaponry made the Tiger H1 one of the most formidable fighting machines of its era.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905650?t=1758622176","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905650?t=1758622176","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905650/f1991ab81f20bf8209025cb91cea4361012f2b5c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758622176","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905650/f1991ab81f20bf8209025cb91cea4361012f2b5c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758622176","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"D